{"id":"602750","name":"玉米白面饼","author":"小不点_June","authorId":"10615518","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/602750/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"玉米粉","amount":"半碗"},{"name":"白面粉","amount":"半碗"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"半袋"}],"sub":[{"name":"韭菜","amount":"3根"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"一小段"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"玉米面，白面粉各半碗，半袋酵母粉，加入适量的水搅拌均匀。","img":"images/602750/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"静放发酵大概三个小时，发至2倍大。","img":"images/602750/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备洗好的韭菜与胡萝卜。","img":"images/602750/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"分别切丁。","img":"images/602750/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入发酵好的面粉中，再加入适量的熟芝麻，鸡精，盐与十三香。","img":"images/602750/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/602750/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"电饼铛预热，刷一层油。","img":"images/602750/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将面糊倒入电饼铛中，铺平。","img":"images/602750/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"上面撒上一层黑芝麻。","img":"images/602750/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盖上改，调好烤饼模式。","img":"images/602750/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"烤熟。","img":"images/602750/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"分切小片。","img":"images/602750/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/602750/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/602750/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}